# Line endings: the repository stores text with LF, and every checkout gets LF too, whatever the
# computer's own Git setting. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turned every
# file into CRLF and broke tests that read the sources (tests/test_mac_dock.js). Windows-only batch
# files (gradlew.bat) are left exactly as they are stored, with the CRLF cmd.exe needs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text

# Never touched as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
